sequenceDiagram
    participant Pi
    participant Ext as This extension
    participant Router as llama.cpp
    Pi->>Ext: Session start or model selected
    Ext->>Router: GET /models: check loaded status
    Router-->>Ext: Selected model is loaded
    Ext->>Router: GET /props: discover native efforts
    Router-->>Ext: low, medium, xhigh (example)
    Ext->>Pi: Enable native efforts and Pi budgets
    Pi->>Router: Prompt + chosen effort + Pi budget
